  "candidate_commit_object": "tree 8cdf0d977ef49bb74f924ed2cecc0c030b4bbd9a\nparent 87cc3a3ce0bc1682d431d1479db0164d48e0f8d2\nauthor Codex <codex@openai.com> 1792490068 +0900\ncommitter Murphy Hoops <murphyhoops@MurphydeMacBook-Pro.local> 1792498256 +0800\n\nfeat(core): close finite support viability and registered joint risk\n\nDerive zero actual uncertified-row occupancy from finite support viability\nand prove the converse. Add an executable support checker, reachable\ndead-end counterexamples, Good-only registered sampling bounds, and a\nsame-policy viability-to-joint adapter with an adaptive finite witness.\n\nRegister observed native types, axioms and proof dependencies without\nchanging the frozen counted Core. Preserve failed attempts and independent\nreviews. Nine-module and full UEOT local builds, native recheck, and all\n28 production evidence-consumer tests passed for the frozen source bytes.\n\nPublication still requires the separate ops policy to enter canonical main."
